  "Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of DEF. There is a <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict the main target with <link=\"s|103\"><u>[Freeze]</u></link> for $2 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Frost and snow converge into a sharp-edged body of ice, inflicting freezing damage to foes, and as the cold seeps through, it may cause them to attach elemental anomalies.</color></size></b>": "",
